---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { href } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Collecting & Enquiries" description="How to enquire about a painting by Keng Seng Choo: artwork details, availability and supporting documentation, with links to his biography and collecting history.">
  <article class="content-page wrap collector-page"><header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">COLLECTING &amp; ENQUIRIES · <span lang="zh">作品收藏咨询</span></p><h1>A painting that<br />speaks to you.</h1><p>Explore the paintings, learn their stories and enquire directly about a work that interests you.</p></header>
    <div class="prose"><h2>Start with the artwork</h2><p>The <a href={href('/works/')}>artwork gallery</a> presents paintings previously published on the artist’s website. Individual pages include recorded details where these are available. Please use the enquiry button on a painting’s page to include its title and reference in your email.</p><h2>What to ask</h2><p>For a particular painting, ask about its current availability, medium, creation date, dimensions, condition and supporting documentation. The website preserves an archive; showing a painting here does not confirm that it is available for sale.</p><p>Prices, viewing arrangements and any delivery details should be discussed directly. Historical auction records describe earlier activity and do not establish a current price.</p><p lang="zh">浏览作品后，可通过作品页面的咨询按钮发送邮件，并附上画名与作品编号。作品现时是否可供收藏、尺寸、媒材、创作年份及相关文件，请直接联系确认。</p><h2>Questions from collectors</h2>
    <details class="collector-question"><summary>Are these paintings available to collect?</summary><p>Please enquire about the individual work. This is a selection from the artist’s published archive, and availability is not listed as current inventory.</p></details>
    <details class="collector-question"><summary>What does “2016 collection” mean?</summary><p>It identifies a group published on the original website in 2016. It does not establish when each painting was created.</p></details>
    <details class="collector-question"><summary>Where can I read about his background and recognition?</summary><p>The <a href={href('/about/')}>artist biography</a> brings together career milestones, institutional recognition, interviews and <a href={href('/about/#recognition')}>dated collecting records</a>.</p></details>
    <details class="collector-question"><summary>How do I identify a painting in my enquiry?</summary><p>Use its title and the reference shown on the artwork page. The email enquiry button includes both automatically.</p></details></div>
    <footer class="article-end"><a class="button" href={href('/works/')}>Explore the artworks ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={href('/contact/')}>Contact ↗</a></footer>
  </article>
</Base>
